cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these constructions or verification artifacts, please cite this repository."
title: "Explicit degree reductions of the three-dimensional Jacobian counterexample"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Andreas"
    family-names: "Finke"
abstract: >-
  Exact polynomial constructions and machine-checkable certificates derived
  from the known three-dimensional Jacobian counterexample, including a
  total-degree-three map in dimension ten and a cubic-homogeneous map in
  dimension eighteen.
repository-code: "https://github.com/AndreasFinke/jacobian-10d"
url: "https://github.com/AndreasFinke/jacobian-10d"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Jacobian conjecture
  - polynomial maps
  - algebraic geometry
  - computer algebra
  - symbolic verification
  - AI-assisted research
